.TH WERKMEISTER-PR-GATE 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-pr\-gate \- Run the pre\-PR gate
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister pr gate\fR [repo]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-wait\fR
Don't wait for host load under budget.host_load before each check
.TP
\fB\-\-tests\fR
Only the lint and test rows, on the uncommitted tree, before a PR file exists
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the result as JSON
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
